        <headline>Small Craft Advisory issued September 26 at 6:38AM PDT until September 27 at 5:00AM PDT by NWS Portland OR</headline>
        <description>* WHAT...Seas 4 to 7 ft at 8 seconds and north winds 10 to 20 kt
with gusts up to 25 kt expected.

* WHERE...Coastal waters from Cape Foulweather to Florence OR
out 10 NM.

* WHEN...From 2 PM this afternoon to 5 AM PDT Sunday.

* IMPACTS...Conditions will be hazardous to small craft.
</description>
        <instruction>Inexperienced mariners, especially those operating smaller
vessels, should avoid navigating in hazardous conditions.</instruction>
